{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Ab]Tell it to ev[C7]ery [Db]kindred and nation, [Ab]Tell it [Eb]far [Ab]and [Eb]near;
[Eb7]Earth's darkest night will [Ab]fade with the dawning, [Eb]Jesus will soon ap[Ab]pear.
